<span style="color:#0000ff;"><span style="font-family:cambria,serif;">Hello ,</span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
It was great talking to you. &nbsp;This is the e-mail we usually send to new leads. &nbsp;Let me know if you have any questions.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:cambria,serif;">Step 1 &ndash; establish that there is in enough interest at the facility to host a blood drive.&nbsp; I&rsquo;ve attached an interest survey.&nbsp; We need to have 45 -55 names on the list with contact information for each donor. &nbsp;If you get to 45 but still think you have a lot more, keep going. &nbsp;The more on the survey, the more staff we&#39;ll send. &nbsp;Once you think you&#39;ve gotten about all you can send me the list and we can move on to step 2.&nbsp; We do not expect every name to show up.&nbsp; We&rsquo;ve got a slight formula we use to guess how many will show.&nbsp; It&rsquo;s not 100% accurate, but it&rsquo;s a good starting point.</span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:cambria,serif;">Step 2 &ndash; select the appropriate space to host the blood drive.&nbsp; We prefer open rooms of more than 1400 sq ft, but depending on the layout and expected attendance we can be flexible.&nbsp; I&rsquo;ll come out and review any spaces you think will work.&nbsp; </span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:cambria,serif;">Step 3 &ndash; Select a date that is good for you and I have space available often times it&rsquo;ll be about 4 months out. </span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:cambria,serif;">Step 4 &ndash; We&rsquo;ll provide you with an online scheduling tool.&nbsp; You promote the drive to prospective donors and they&rsquo;ll sign up.&nbsp; You&rsquo;ll need to have about 25 chairs and 10 tables in the room we have the drive.&nbsp; </span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:cambria,serif;">Step 5 &ndash; The drive!&nbsp; Red Cross will bring the staff, tools, and refreshments and together we&rsquo;ll save some lives!</span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:cambria,serif;">If any donors have questions about eligibility, they should call 1-866-236-3276. </span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:cambria,serif;">Please let me know if you have any questions or if I can help in anyways.</span><br />
&nbsp;</span><br />
<b><span style="color:#1F497D;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;">Yours in Service,</span></span></span></b><br />
